      "writtenOn": "2025-01-23T19:56:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have not been able to identify any third-party launchers that support Private Space yet. I have tried a few. Nova Launcher treats it as a Work profile, but it doesn\u0027t show any of the apps anywhere. I did try to see if I could install Launcher3 (non-Quickstep) on stock, but it crashes due to trying to use hidden APIs, so we can\u0027t use it to test, either. So it\u0027s going to be a challenge to test whether any solution we come up with for third-party launchers is going to work, right now.\n\nWhile I think supporting third-party launchers is nice, I don\u0027t personally think it needs to be a blocker, especially given that we don\u0027t have anything to verify against.",
